[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900200_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900200_02_0010","text":"……嘿……\n哈……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900200_02_0020","text":"嗒！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900200_02_0030","text":"……呼……\nProducer，怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900200_02_0040","text":"嗯，整体都很好\n就是最后的姿势，再多一点气势就更好了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900200_02_0050","text":"就像这样……手“唰！”地一下\n脚要有力地……“嗒！”地踏出去的感觉"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900200_02_0060","text":"原来如此～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900200_02_0070","text":"“唰！”然后“嗒！”是吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900200_02_0080","text":"不对，可以再更有气势一点\n……唰——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900200_02_0090","text":"……唰——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900200_02_0100","text":"……唰——！"}]
